{"unit_id": "tag:0F1L:statement", "translation": "在上述情形下，设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>的一个对象（object）。那么<MATH_0003>属于（全忠实（fully faithful）的）函子（functor）<MATH_0004>的本质（essential）像（image），当且仅当下列两个条件成立\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>中为零，且\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>是仿射开集（affine open），<MATH_0009>是标准开集（standard open）（代数（Algebra），定义<REF_0001>），则映射（map）<MATH_0010>，即景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0002>中的映射，是一个拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "essential", "target_term": "本质"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "quasi-isomorphism", "target_term": "拟同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "导出对象"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实", "context": "比较函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "比较函子"}, {"source_term": "essential", "target_term": "本质", "context": "本质像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "本质像"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "局部条件"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "局部条件"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "章节名"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调", "context": "章节名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-isomorphism", "target_term": "拟同构", "context": "结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0F1L:proof", "translation": "（函子（functor）<MATH_0001>由景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），节<REF_0001>中的讨论是全忠实（fully faithful）的。）除去一个与空（empty）集（set）有关的问题，这由非常一般的景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0002>得到；该引理的假设由概形（Schemes），引理<REF_0003>和景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites），引理<REF_0004>满足。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为绕过这个问题，用<MATH_0002>表示空（empty）对象（object）<MATH_0003>具有两个覆盖（coverings）的景（site），即<MATH_0004>和空（empty）覆盖（covering）（相关讨论见景（Sites），例<REF_0005>）。于是有景（sites）的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0005>\n。上述论证适用于第一个箭头。然后留给读者验证，<MATH_0006>作为<MATH_0007>的一个对象（object），属于（全忠实（fully faithful）的）函子（functor）<MATH_0008>的本质（essential）像（image），当且仅当<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>中为零。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "essential", "target_term": "本质"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "比较函子"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调", "context": "章节名"}, {"so